    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_3_e2",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_7",
      "quote": "To inform decision makers on the best choice of individual tests, an aggregated, widely available, and frequently updated assessment of the quality, performance, and independence of the data is urgently needed.",
      "reason": "The introduction explicitly explains the importance and need for the review to inform decision makers with an aggregated assessment."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_3_e3",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_7",
      "quote": "While other systematic reviews have been published, they include data only up until November 2020 [8-11], exclude preprints [12], or were industry sponsored [13]. In addition, only 1 assessed the quality of studies in detail, with data up until November 2020 [7,11]. With our systematic review and meta-analysis, we aim to close this gap in the literature...",
      "reason": "The introduction identifies existing systematic reviews, cites them, and explains the need for the current review to address gaps in data timeliness, preprint inclusion, and independence."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_3_e4",
      "status": "NOT_APPLICABLE",
      "chunk_id": "text_7",
      "quote": null,
      "reason": "This is a diagnostic accuracy review, not a review of intervention effects, so the mechanism of action of an intervention is not applicable."
    },
    {
